127
00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.730
And for corporate use cases,

128
00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:17.839
this is crucial for expanding the
LLM's knowledge of your organization.

129
00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.529
And so the extraction
process for Microsoft PowerPoint

130
00:07:21.529 --> 00:07:24.050
is actually very similar to HTML,

131
