161
00:09:41.159 --> 00:09:44.980
PDFs are a little bit
different than HTML or PowerPoint,

162
00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.500
whereas in those documents,

163
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:49.559
you are looking at
semi-structured information for clues

164
00:09:49.559 --> 00:09:52.990
about how to divide element
types within the documents.

165
00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:55.909
In PDFs or images, you're going
to look for something different.

166
00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:57.679
You're going to look for visual cues.

167
00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:01.919
And so in PDFs, you're looking for
things like formatting within the document.

168
00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.809
So a piece of text
within a PDF that's bold and

169
00:10:05.809 --> 00:10:08.519
