228
00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:07.929
As you can see, the content changed.

229
00:14:08.879 --> 00:14:12.379
And so if you have a file of your
own that you'd like to partition,

230
00:14:12.379 --> 00:14:15.179
you can use the widget to
upload it and then partition it.

231
00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.399
So this concludes the first lesson.

232
00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.870
I encourage you to try this on
your own documents, upload a few,

233
00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:24.120
and then experiment with the library
and see what the outputs look like.

234
00:14:24.559 --> 00:14:28.960
In the next lesson, you'll learn about
